(slower-b747-sv01-descent-corridor-3dof)
*title B747 point-mass descent corridor reduction
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3
*units/fmt long deg f.3
*units/fmt lat deg f.3
*units/fmt gama deg f.3
*units/fmt psi deg f.3
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0.0 longitude-deg=0.02 altitude-m=60.0
*runtime status route mode=great-circle start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=20.0 powered-speed-mps=153.0
*trajectory 1 b747 start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=100.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=153.0 gama=0.0 psi=90.0 time=0.0 mass=288756.9
  *segment 1 descent-corridor
    *integ dtprnt=0.2 dt=0.05
    *fly alpha=3.1
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) sref=510.96672
    *prop thrust=(thrust) mdot=0
    *when time>20.0 stop
*end
